"To edit or delete a certificate before it is activated, hover over the top "
"right corner of the form and select {em_start}Edit{em_end} or the delete "
"icon."
msgstr ""
"Pour modifier ou supprimer un certificat avant son activation, survolez le "
"coin supérieur droit du formulaire et sélectionnez "
"{em_start}Modifier{em_end} ou l'icône de suppression."

#: cms/templates/certificates.html:95
#, python-brace-format
